-- a collision as data: two molecules that are not identical and whose digests are. The InChIKey's
-- collision rate is published (1.3% of pairs at 10^9 structures), so for the digest the field uses
-- to mean identity this type is inhabited.
Collision : (D : Type 0) → (Mol → D) → Type 1
Collision D d = (M : Mol) × (N : Mol) × (d M ≡ d N) × ((M ≡ N) → Empty)
